/// Queue a message for the IO thread, taking ownership of `msg`.
///
/// We centralize all our logic into this spot so we can intercept
/// messages for example in readonly mode.
fn queueIo(
    self: *Surface,
    msg: termio.Message,
    mutex: termio.Termio.MutexState,
